          "start": 460,
          "end": 970,
          "quote": "The optometrist's current signed sheet records uncorrected visual acuity of 6/12 in the right eye and 6/18 in the left eye, then records corrected visual acuity of 6/6 in the right eye and 6/9 in the left eye with the prescribed lenses; the same specialist assessment documents no visual field defect, no diplopia and binocular rather than monocular vision, while the driver's recollection of driving comfortably without spectacles is retained as an account of behaviour rather than an alternative measurement.",
